   "title": "Note: 3 - Save + next steps",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 3 - Then\n\nSave the result as the new face reference (`face_reference_B.png`), then:\n1. rebuild the character sheet from it;\n2. open the clip workflow, swap in the new reference and the new sheet, keep the prompt and the **seed**, and render;\n3. cut the wide shot out and make its keyref (keyref workflow, identity from the NEW clip's close-up);\n4. run the one-shot FaceRefine Plus workflow on it.\n\nThe example's results are in `assets/<character>/method_b/`. Its `face_reference_B.png` was picked by ArcFace among 3 seeds and several frames, so this workflow's output with the default frames and seed is similar but not identical."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## 3 - Then\n\nSave the result as the new face reference (`face_reference_B.png`), then:\n1. rebuild the character sheet from it;\n2. open the clip workflow, swap in the new reference and the new sheet, keep the prompt and the **seed**, and render;\n3. cut the wide shot out and make its keyref (keyref workflow, identity from the NEW clip's close-up);\n4. run the one-shot FaceRefine Plus workflow on it.\n\nThe example's results are in `assets/<character>/method_b/`. Its `face_reference_B.png` was picked by ArcFace among 3 seeds and several frames, so this workflow's output with the default frames and seed is similar but not identical."
   },
